@startuml CI Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2196F3
skinparam ActivityFontColor #1565C0
skinparam ArrowColor #1976D2
skinparam ActivityBarColor #1976D2

title Continuous Integration Workflow (ci.yml)\nTriggers: push(master) / pull_request / merge_group / workflow_dispatch

|#E8F4FD|Setup & Detection|
start

fork
  :Setup Environment Variables;
fork again
  :Determine Baseline Availability;
  note right
    Download trusted master artifacts,
    re-upload into this run:
    module coverage, perushim data,
    app E2E coverage (android/ios)
  end note
fork again
  :Determine Docker Image Availability;
  note right
    LCOV artifact + GHCR Sefaria
    MongoDB (tree-hash tag),
    can_publish flag for forks
  end note
end fork

:Determine Changes;
note right
  determine-changes.ts —
  module_changed (release) vs
  ci_changed (test/tooling only)
  per module, per event base
end note

fork
  :Build LCOV Docker Image;
  note right: only on artifact miss
fork again
  :Build Sefaria MongoDB Image;
  note right: only when GHCR tag missing
fork again
  :Perushim Data;
  note right: regenerate SQL + SQLite artifacts
end fork

|#E8F5E9|Module CI (Conditional)|
note
  Each runs if: module changed OR
  ci changed OR baseline missing.
  Differential E2E selection computes
  manifests in SHADOW mode — suites
  still run everything.
end note

fork
  :Website CI;
  note right: Lint, Unit, E2E (cov)
fork again
  :Website Performance;
  note right: Lighthouse
fork again
  :API CI;
  note right: Lint, Unit, E2E (llvm-cov)
fork again
  :Admin CI;
  note right: Lint, Unit, E2E (cov)
fork again
  :App CI;
  note right: Lint, Unit, Integration
fork again
  :App Mobile E2E;
  note right
    app-mobile-e2e.yml:
    android leg + shared iOS build
    + planned iOS shards -> merge_ios
  end note
fork again
  :App iOS native audio CI;
  note right: PR only — WebKit/Chromium
fork again
  :Bulletin CI;
  note right: Lint, Fmt, Unit
fork again
  :Data CI;
  note right: Lint, Unit, Integration
fork again
  :Recitation alignment & RustFS;
  note right: invariants + storage tests
end fork

|#F3E5F5|Cross Module CI|
:Check Prerequisites (required gate);
note right
  Detection jobs must succeed;
  every triggered suite must report
  success — skipped/failed blocks merge.
  app_ios_ci skipped OK off-PR.
end note
:Restore Coverage Reports;
note right
  From module CI (run artifact)
  OR re-uploaded master baseline.
  App = unit+integration+E2E(android+ios)
  merged hits-only.
end note
:Publish to Codecov & Codacy;
note right: + website JUnit test_results report

|#FFEBEE|Package (Master push only)|
fork
  :Package Website;
  note right: Docker image
fork again
  :Package API;
  note right: Docker image
fork again
  :Package Admin;
  note right: Docker image
fork again
  :Package Bulletin;
  note right: Lambda zip
fork again
  :Package App (app-package.yml);
  note right: MSIX + AAB + IPA + asset packs
end fork

|#E3F2FD|Release (Master push only)|
fork
  :Release Website / API / Admin;
  note right
    Tag + GitHub Release
    Trigger deploy-aws
  end note
fork again
  :Release Bulletin;
  note right
    Tag + GitHub Release
    Trigger deploy-bulletin
  end note
fork again
  :Release App;
  note right
    Tag + GitHub Release
    Trigger deploy-app
    (msix, aab, ipa, assetpacks, payloads)
  end note
fork again
  :Release Data;
  note right
    Pinned perushim SQL archive
    Trigger deploy-data
  end note
end fork

:Bump Versions;
note right: master push, [skip ci]

stop

@enduml
